    <detaileddescription>
<para>This header provides production-ready patterns for handling moved objects safely:<orderedlist>
<listitem><para>StateSnapshot - Capture object metadata before move</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>HandleRegistry - ID-based lookup after move <linebreak/>
</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>MoveGuard - Verify object validity post-move</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>SnapshotValidator - Validate snapshot consistency </para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
